Cell[TextData[{
 "This is the master equation for the metric perturbation under the even \
parity sector, in terms of a single function, K[t,r]\n\n",
 StyleBox["[IN PROGRESS]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nObtaining the canonical Zerilli equation requires more work. "
}], "Text",
